    "title": "Interleave the First Half of Queue",
    "category": "Queue",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "Given a queue containing an even number of integers, interleave the first half of the queue with the second half. For example, if the queue is: 1 2 3 4 the result should be: 1 3 2 4 Return the modified queue.",
